{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "90e4a626cd46500f32ccb02fcc12eb6fb843e15890cc0ae619e6a467ad9d6d81", "ja": "よっ、{$P$}！\nいきなりだけど、あんた、腹減ってないか？", "zh": "嗨，{$P$}！\n我知道有点突然，但你肚子饿不饿啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9211f65e77a793a03d715f8f0754a6e7d43a5c4a19e2505a53f56d9d7fedcb51", "ja": "そういえば、もういい時間だな。\nジュリアもまだなら、何か食べに行くか？", "zh": "这么一说，也差不多该吃饭了。\n如果茱莉亚也还没吃的话，要不要一起出去吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "47ead72bebab112dd1c86015a88dc82c3ec5fbcae775b77cb820f1d5d0283872", "ja": "その必要はないぜ！　あんたの分も、\n弁当作ってきてやったんだ。さ、食べな！", "zh": "不必了！我自己做了便当，也准备了你的份。\n来，吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6dbfd0b30e9ba6a99a274c7933e0432a7763dcc624b5f4a49984cb30d2451a8f", "ja": "弁当……じ、ジュリアが！？", "zh": "便当……茱、茱莉亚做的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "11ca5c75b4d4a7eb611b5e1635e103146ec2f97ed63f3b78a1e257465d5bcd1d", "ja": "おいおい、驚きすぎだろ……。\nこの前のバカンスで、ちょっと料理に目覚めてさ♪", "zh": "喂喂，你也太吃惊了吧……\n之前度假时，我对做料理产生了兴趣♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "1ae21c90f7979d3b0b38f4fc414e1d99de104c0a6cd5cbf587f9e31bdb55ea1e", "ja": "メニューはゴマ塩のおにぎり、塩ジャケ、\nそれと野菜の塩もみだ。どうだ、うまそうだろ？", "zh": "菜色是芝麻盐饭团、盐烤鲑鱼\n跟盐渍蔬菜。怎么样，感觉很好吃吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d5687eed96a997c07ffa4098ad6d4406643d22ed302d423ac0a8e8d359b918e8", "ja": "なんだか塩のフルコースみたいだな……。", "zh": "听起来像是盐巴全餐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "e843aa0c4b9b4c616ab86607bb99af432835781ef3bce7c566f8109cb337ac28", "ja": "ああ。だって、塩は料理の基本なんだろ？\nなら、まずは基本をマスターしないと……ってね。", "zh": "对啊。毕竟盐是料理中的基本嘛。\n所以我想说得先掌握基本才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0042_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "85c88c29476dd97fe71508ec3e6f7cd9621c113d1af451b8230ba15a9daf4b56", "ja": "そういうワケだから、味見役よろしくな、\n{$P$}♪", "zh": "就是这样，麻烦你试吃看看啰，\n{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
